    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SUPERB STONE BUILT RESIDENCE WITH OUTBUILDINGS AND\r\nMATURE GROUNDS ON C. 7.6 HECTARES   (C. 18.77 ACRES)\r\n\r\nBallinanty, constructed in 1982, and finished with recycled granite which is also extensively used in pathways, walls, steps and kerbing throughout the property. Set in rolling countryside between Greenan and Aughrim, is a spectacular property with four Reception rooms, spacious Kitchen/Breakfast room and four/five Bedrooms. Set well back from the road and approached via a tarmacadam driveway through exquisite gardens, the property offers the ultimate in privacy and seclusion set in the Garden of Ireland. \r\n\r\nRathdrum, which is 15 minutes drive, offers a variety of Shops and Restaurants and First and Second level schools. Aughrim is a similar distance and Arklow C. 20 Kms away has a choice of shopping including the Bridgewater Shopping Centre, and a choice of First and Second level Schools.  \r\n\r\nThe Local area is renowned for hill walking, fishing, and horse riding, golf enthusiasts and well catered for at Macreddin, Woodenbridge, Arklow, and Coolattin Golf Clubs. The Brooklodge Hotel and Glenmlaure Lodge are renowned Hotels and Restaurants in the area. Bus and Train connections to the City are available from Arklow and Rathdrum and South Dublin is accessible within an hour’s car drive. The grounds and gardens of the Property are a Gardeners dream. The House sits in manicured lawns with an abundance of rare shrubs and trees. A series of walkways lead to numerous water features boasting rear plants, lilies etc. there is a spectacular cherry tree walk in a mature wooded setting. A separate entrance least to a generous parking area, with large Garage, Stables, Polytunnel, glasshouse and Leanto shed and Store. The Agricultural Lands are serviced by an integral roadway, electricity and water and have a three bay Leanto with three stables, hay storage area etc. The Agricultural Lands are in grassland and have good road frontage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\t10.9m x 3.5m\t\t\r\ntiled floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room\t\t6m x 4.2m\t\t\r\nCanadian maple flooring. Open fireplace with back boiler. \r\nBay window SLIDING DOORS to\r\n\r\nDining Room\t\t4.3m x 3.5m\t\t\r\nCanadian maple floor DOOR TO KITCHEN\r\n\r\nSun Room\t\t2.8m x 2.8m\t\r\nTerracotta tiled floor DOUBLE DOORS to GARDEN\r\n\r\nKitchen/\r\nBreakfast Room\t5.8m x 6.5m\t\t\r\nrange of oak fitted Kitchen units quartz  worktop with tiled splashback. \r\nRayburn oil fired cooker heating radiators. Terracotta tiled floor\r\n\r\nUtility Room\t\t3.6m x 2.4m\t\t\r\ntiled floor. Fitted units\r\n\r\nConservatory\t\t6.7m x 2m\t\t\r\ntiled floor. DOOR to REAR PATIO\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n(Master)\t\t       7.7m x 5m\t\t\r\noak floors, fitted wardrobes ENSUITE: 2.8m x 1.7m oak\r\nfloor, tiled shower W.C. and W.H.B.\r\n\r\nBathroom\t      3.7m x 1.7m\t\t\r\noak floor, bath W.C. and W.H.B.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t\t3.7m x 3.8m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t\t5.2m x 3.5m\t\t\r\ntiled floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\t\t3.5m x 3.3m\t\t\r\nmaple flooring\r\n\r\nThe following space within the House in Registered Commercial Space\r\n\r\nRear Porch\t\t2m x 2m\t\t\r\ntiled floor LEADING to\r\n\r\nRear Lobby\t\t3.7m x 3.2m\t\t\r\nmarmoleum flooring\r\n\r\nGuest Toilet\t\t3m x 1.3m\t\t\r\ntiled floor, W.C. and W.H.B.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5/\r\nSurgery\t\t        3.6m x 3.2m\t\t\r\nmarmoleum flooring. Wash hand basin\r\n\r\nOutside:\t\r\nThe Property is approached through electric gates over a winding tarmac \r\ndriveway to a spacious parking area.  The formal gardens to front comprise \r\ngenerous lawns with an abundance of mature trees and shrubs. An Orchard to\r\nthe side of the property has an abundance of fruit trees, polytunnel etc. \r\n\r\nRear entrance again via electric gates lends to spacious yard with stone \r\nbuilt Garage, Leanto shed with storage and Stabling. The Property is further \r\nenhanced by a large area of native woodland featuring gravelled walkways, \r\nseveral ponds with water features cherry tree walk etc. \r\n\r\nThe Western side of the Property comprises Agricultural lands suitable \r\nfor grazing of horses, cattle etc. There is a 3 Bay Leanto/Shed with \r\nthree Stables immediately adjacent to the Lands, which are serviced by \r\nan internal farm roadway.\r\n\r\nServices:\t\r\nWell Water\r\nGravity fed Water for outside use\r\nDual Central Heating\r\nSeptic Tank Drainage\r\nSolar panels for water heating\r\nBroadband\r\nFully Alarmed"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "C. 245 SQ.M. LIVING SPACE\r\nFULLY ALARMED\r\nREGISTERED COMMERCIAL FACILITIES\r\nSTUNNING LAWNED GARDENS.\r\nMATURE NATIVE WOODLAND\r\nNUMEROUS PONDS AND WATER FEATURES\r\nHAVEN FOR WILDLIFE IN A UNIQUE WOODED SETTING\r\nVERSATILE ACCOMMODATION WITH SPACIOUS RECEPTION AREAS, 4/5 BEDROOMS/OFFICE\r\nUSEFUL OUTBUILDINGS\r\nGRAZING LAND\r\nLONG ROAD FRONTAGE, SITE POTENTIAL (SUBJECT TO PLANNING)"
